    "text": "Emain Ablach, the Isle of Apples, is a magical island in Irish myth. It is a place of everlasting summer, where the trees always bloom and the people never grow old. The hero Bran sailed from the great west to find it, drawn by a vision and by the woman who bade his ship to follow her. On its shore he spent years in joy, yet time there moves more slowly than in our world. A sailor who leapt ashore on Ireland aged to dust in a single moment.",
